      "side": 1,
      "message": "I asked on the group, and I guess we can migrate once b/172687320 is done?\n\nFWIW, Android uses BoringSSL, which does not have feature parity to OpenSSL (and later I need a missing one of PKCS#7 signature verification).  Re-using the \"standard\" OpenSSL wrapper may add confusion in Android context.",
